{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"1696512","self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512","key":"SERVER-56509","fields":{"summary":"Wrap unique index insertion _keyExists call in a WT cursor reconfigure.","issuetype":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issuetype/4","id":"4","description":"An improvement or enhancement to an existing feature or task.","iconUrl":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=14710&avatarType=issuetype","name":"Improvement","subtask":false,"avatarId":14710},"components":[],"created":"2021-04-30T01:36:22.000+0000","description":"Follow on work from WT-7264 which is adding a new cursor flag, the flag allows the search near to exit early instead of walking numerous not visible entries.\r\n\r\nThe patch I was using when testing the change is:\r\n{noformat}\r\ndiff --git a/src/mongo/db/storage/wiredtiger/wiredtiger_index.cpp b/src/mongo/db/storage/wiredtiger/wiredtiger_index.cpp\r\nindex 87bda0ace9..7eef9c8528 100644\r\n--- a/src/mongo/db/storage/wiredtiger/wiredtiger_index.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/mongo/db/storage/wiredtiger/wiredtiger_index.cpp\r\n@@ -1520,9 +1520,11 @@ Status WiredTigerIndexUnique::_insert(OperationContext* opCtx,\r\n         setKey(c, prefixKeyItem.Get());\r\n         ret = WT_OP_CHECK(wiredTigerCursorRemove(opCtx, c));\r\n         invariantWTOK(ret);\r\n-\r\n+        c->reconfigure(c, \"prefix_key=true\");\r\n         // Second phase looks up for existence of key to avoid insertion of duplicate key\r\n-        if (_keyExists(opCtx, c, keyString.getBuffer(), sizeWithoutRecordId)) {\r\n+        auto key_exists = _keyExists(opCtx, c, keyString.getBuffer(), sizeWithoutRecordId);\r\n+        c->reconfigure(c, \"prefix_key=false\");\r\n+        if (key_exists) {\r\n             auto key = KeyString::toBson(\r\n                 keyString.getBuffer(), sizeWithoutRecordId, _ordering, keyString.getTypeBits());\r\n             auto entry = _desc->getEntry(); {noformat}\r\nI think that should be all the required changes.","reporter":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/31233","id":"31233","name":"4.4.7","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2021-07-14"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/31439","id":"31439","name":"5.0.0-rc2","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2021-06-16"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/version/32209","id":"32209","description":"","name":"5.1.0-rc0","archived":false,"released":true,"releaseDate":"2021-10-11"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/resolution/13201","id":"13201","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"labels":[],"attachment":[{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/attachment/317160","id":"317160","filename":"image-2021-05-26-13-41-06-320.png","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"created":"2021-05-26T03:41:07.000+0000","size":28959,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/attachment/317160/image-2021-05-26-13-41-06-320.png","thumbnail":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/thumbnail/317160/_thumb_317160.png"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/attachment/316977","id":"316977","filename":"repro.js","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"created":"2021-05-25T16:31:22.000+0000","size":1317,"mimeType":"text/javascript","content":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/attachment/316977/repro.js"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/attachment/316982","id":"316982","filename":"Screen Shot 2021-05-24 at 9.44.50 PM.png","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"created":"2021-05-25T16:35:45.000+0000","size":642166,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/attachment/316982/Screen+Shot+2021-05-24+at+9.44.50+PM.png","thumbnail":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/thumbnail/316982/_thumb_316982.png"}],"versions":[],"resolutiondate":"2021-06-07T17:00:21.000+0000","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3753547","id":"3753547","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"body":"The related ticket has been merged to mongodb-master.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"created":"2021-05-04T08:57:07.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-04T08:57:07.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3793314","id":"3793314","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=alex.podelko%40mongodb.com","name":"alex.podelko@mongodb.com","key":"JIRAUSER1257325","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409"},"displayName":"Alex Podelko","active":false,"timeZone":"UTC"},"body":"[~luke.pearson] What is the plan for that ticket? Do I understand correctly that the WT-7264 fix we were waiting for TPC-C performance issues is not working until that ticket would be done?","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=alex.podelko%40mongodb.com","name":"alex.podelko@mongodb.com","key":"JIRAUSER1257325","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=JIRAUSER1257325&avatarId=28409"},"displayName":"Alex Podelko","active":false,"timeZone":"UTC"},"created":"2021-05-19T21:55:01.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-19T21:55:01.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3794779","id":"3794779","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"body":"[~luke.pearson], related to [my recent comment|https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/WT-7264?focusedCommentId=3794678&page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels%3Acomment-tabpanel#comment-3794678] in WT-7264, does it make sense to also apply this optimization when seeking for keys, not just for insertion?","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"created":"2021-05-20T14:53:56.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-20T15:35:25.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3823024","id":"3823024","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"body":"Sorry for the delay to reply, I'll bring the conversation from WT-7264 over to here so its all in one place.\r\n{quote}[~luke.pearson] is the original regression only a problem when calling search_near() after inserting+removing within the same transaction? Or would this regression also apply to readers that call search_near() in subsequent transactions? My intuition says that this would be a problem for other transactions since these tombstones must be traversed\r\n{quote}\r\nGiven that we can't guarantee that it'll land on the prefix in other transactions we can't guarantee the current implementation of prefix search near will work correctly, we can look at extending it to handle other scenarios. I'll raise this with [~brian.lane] \r\n{quote}[~luke.pearson] What is the plan for that ticket? Do I understand correctly that the WT-7264 fix we were waiting for TPC-C performance issues is not working until that ticket would be done?\r\n{quote}\r\nSERVER-56509 needs to be completed before the prefix search near fix will take effect, however I cannot confirm that it will resolve the TPC-C regression as we discussed separately on the BF.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"created":"2021-05-25T00:17:24.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-25T00:18:18.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3838417","id":"3838417","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"body":"I wrote a reproducer (attached as \"repro.js\") for the multi-update problem, and the \"prefix_key\" change does not appear to have completely resolved the regression related to updates on unique indexes. Locally, a multi-update on a non-unique index field for 10K docs took about 250ms. The same update on a unique field took about 15s without the \"prefix_key\" change and about 8s with the \"prefix_key\" change.\r\n\r\nI also discovered that the regression only exists if a unique field is updated to a value that sorts before the original key. For example, updating an index field from \"ZZZ\" to \"AAA\" triggers the regression, but updating the same field from \"AAA\" to \"ZZZ\" does not. I assume this is because of the way MongoDB constructs KeyStrings for seeking when calling _keyExists.\r\n\r\nPerf screenshot with the \"prefix_key\" change applied: \r\n!Screen Shot 2021-05-24 at 9.44.50 PM.png|width=100%! \r\n\r\nI have not been able to reproduce a problem with multi-deletes.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=louis.williams%40mongodb.com","name":"louis.williams@mongodb.com","key":"louis.williams","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=louis.williams&avatarId=23008"},"displayName":"Louis Williams","active":true,"timeZone":"America/New_York"},"created":"2021-05-25T16:36:23.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-25T16:48:19.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3840476","id":"3840476","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"body":"That is very interesting, and the I have run the reproducer and see the same regression. I've spend some time comparing the unique index scenario with the non unique scenario and also took a look at the FTDC data from both.\r\n\r\nFrom the FTDC it's clear that the prefix search near code isn't coming into affect until we begin the update portion of the workload which is after the ~10 second hang:\r\n\r\n!image-2021-05-26-13-41-06-320.png!\r\n\r\nThis is curious as I'm fairly certain the insert path is going through the same function. I've also wrapped the {{isDup}} call to {{_keyExists}} in a reconfigure for prefix search and not seen any positive impact from that.\r\n\r\nI'm not clear on where these next and prev calls are originating from so I'll continue to try and narrow that down.\r\n\r\n ","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"created":"2021-05-26T03:44:54.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-26T03:44:54.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3840520","id":"3840520","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"body":"I did notice that we're doing a lot of nexts and prevs in the insert list path which wasn't optimised for prefix searching, so I added a check there and resolved a lot of regression but also made the insertion phase worse.\r\n{noformat}\r\n> load('server-repro.js')\r\nstarting bulk load on unique\r\ninserted 10000\r\nWed May 26 2021 15:34:17 GMT+1000 (AEST)...bulk load on unique: 2180ms\r\nstarting update on unique\r\nWed May 26 2021 15:34:19 GMT+1000 (AEST)...update on unique: 378ms\r\ntrue\r\n> {noformat}\r\nIt is expected that comparing keys with prefixes would be slow which is why I opted not to include it in the insert list scenario. Given that the update case is now quick I'm guessing that it too is taking the insert list path, but in the normal case why is it's insert list checking taking 8 seconds of time, reduced to 300ms with my fix?","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"created":"2021-05-26T05:40:19.000+0000","updated":"2021-05-26T05:40:19.000+0000"},{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/issue/1696512/comment/3849159","id":"3849159","author":{"self":"https://jira.mongodb.org/rest/api/2/user?username=luke.pearson%40mongodb.com","name":"luke.pearson@mongodb.com","key":"luke.pearson","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","24x24":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","16x16":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509","32x32":"https://jira.mongodb.org/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=luke.pearson&avatarId=21509"},"displayName":"Luke Pearson","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Vancouver"},"body":"I have discussed this with the team and we are planning on scoping out a project to handle further search_near optimisations including the second regression identified by Louis.","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://jira.